      </p>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="#petales" class="inline-flex items-center h-12 px-7 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-semibold transition-colors" style="background:#2A2520; color:#FBF3EE;">Voir les compositions</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="inline-flex items-center h-12 px-7 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-semibold border" style="border-color:#2A2520; color:#2A2520;">Commander</a>
